    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="30.9">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 30.9</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif heo] forð ne cume, fo se cyng to þam wé́re ⁊ beo seo þeof utlah wið eal folc.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if he fails, the king shall take the wergeld, and the thief shall be treated as an outlaw by the whole nation.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif heo forð ne cume, fo se cingc to þam were. ⁊ beo se þeof utlah wið eal folc.</ab>
      </div>
